 <bp:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">REPLACED http://pathwaycommons.org/pc12/ProteinReference_HPRD_08934_identity</bp:comment>
 <bp:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">FUNCTION: Plays a central role as a glucosyl donor in cellularmetabolic pathways.CATALYTIC ACTIVITY:Reaction=alpha-D-glucose 1-phosphate + H(+) + UTP = diphosphate +UDP-alpha-D-glucose; Xref=Rhea:RHEA:19889, ChEBI:CHEBI:15378,ChEBI:CHEBI:33019, ChEBI:CHEBI:46398, ChEBI:CHEBI:58601,ChEBI:CHEBI:58885; EC=2.7.7.9;SUBUNIT: Homooctamer. {ECO:0000269|PubMed:22132858}.SUBCELLULAR LOCATION: Cytoplasm {ECO:0000269|PubMed:8354390}.ALTERNATIVE PRODUCTS:Event=Alternative splicing; Named isoforms=2;Name=1;IsoId=Q16851-1; Sequence=Displayed;Name=2;IsoId=Q16851-2; Sequence=VSP_012834;Note=Initiator Met-1 is removed. Contains a N-acetylserine atposition 2. Contains a phosphoserine at position 2.{ECO:0000244|PubMed:20068231, ECO:0000244|PubMed:21406692,ECO:0000244|PubMed:22223895, ECO:0000244|PubMed:22814378};SIMILARITY: Belongs to the UDPGP type 1 family. {ECO:0000305}.CAUTION: The human genome was initially thought to contain 2 genesfor UTP--glucose-1-phosphate uridylyltransferase: UGP1 and UGP2.However, the sequence defined as UGP1 (PubMed:8354390) probablydoes not exist and corresponds to UGP2.{ECO:0000305|PubMed:8354390}. COPYRIGHT: UniProt Consortium (www.uniprot.org). Distributed under the Creative Commons Attribution-NoDerivs License.</bp:comment>
 <bp:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">REPLACED http://mirtarbase.mbc.nctu.edu.tw/#ref_7360</bp:comment>
 <bp:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">REPLACED http://biocyc.org/biopax/biopax-level3ProteinReference110612</bp:comment>
 <bp:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">REPLACED http://identifiers.org/uniprot/E7EUC7</bp:comment>
 <bp:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">REPLACED http://pathwaycommons.org/pc12/ProteinReference_uniprotkb_Q16851_identity</bp:comment>
 <bp:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">REPLACED http://identifiers.org/refseq/XP_011531393</bp:comment>
